# The exact bytes this project's results were computed from (D-020). One line per reference file
# it reads (genome FASTA, GTF, annotation, database), in `sha256sum` format:
#
#     sha256sum /proj/nobackup/hpc2n2024-150/Rytis/Data/<ref>/genome.fa >> conf/references.sha256
#
# Archived with every release, so a DOI names the reference as well as the code. A project that
# reads no reference data says so instead, on a line of its own:  none: <why>
# `pixi run release-check` refuses a tag while this file holds neither.
# The ctx modules' references, as each conf/datasets file records them: SHA-256 measured on
# download, path under the ctx root. The cluster runs' genome FASTA, read from each run's refs/,
# is not here yet: its checksum is measured on Kebnekaise (TODO(rytis): paste it in).
